cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "AAA-RNS: AI Agent-driven Autonomous Research Notebook System"
abstract: >-
  An offline, server-free research notebook that builds a project-specific
  documentation system from a laboratory's own planning documents, drafts
  research notes from uploaded experiment logs and measurement data, links
  every generated sentence to an entry in an evidence ledger, and refuses to
  seal a note containing a claim the ledger does not support. Sealed notes are
  chained with a SHA-256 hash covering both content and signatures. Runs
  entirely in the browser with no external dependencies, in Korean, English
  and Japanese.
type: software
authors:
