url: "https://github.com/hopejsh/aaa-rns"
# Zenodo issues two DOIs. The concept DOI always resolves to the newest
# release and is what a reader normally wants; the version DOI is frozen to a
# single release and is what you cite when the exact bytes matter — a
# reproducibility statement, for instance.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21937754
identifiers:
